      "label": "common_0170_legend_01",
      "hash64": "B8B3B109A9AE312F",
      "text": "Grooo...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0170_rival_12",
      "hash64": "3BFA8F43B399F598",
      "text": "Mannomann, je länger man es anschaut, desto\\nseltsamer wird es![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_0170_rival_13",
      "hash64": "3BFA9043B399F74B",
      "text": "Ich möchte auf jeden Fall gegen es antreten,\\nwenn du es trainiert hast![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_0170_rival_14",
      "hash64": "3BFA9543B399FFCA",
      "text": "Aber jetzt sollten wir uns nach den ganzen\\nStrapazen erst mal ausruhen. Komm, legen wir\\r\\nauf dem Leuchtturm eine Verschnaufpause ein![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
